# Downloaded source audio (the freely-licensed files a rendered clip is cut
# from) are LOCAL artifacts, never committed — they can be large and are
# re-fetched from their `source_url`. The committed record is
# `../manifest.toml`: each entry's provenance (source_url + audio_sha256 +
# segment + gain_db + render_cmd) identifies the exact source file and how the
# clip was reproduced.
#
# Ignore every source file in this directory; keep only this .gitignore.
*
!.gitignore
